<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Constitution (Amendment) Act 2022."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@> .
