<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act is deemed to have come into operation on 15 December 2021. New Article 119a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/9/eng@> .
